        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">FF148 fixes a bug where finding text in a page would not open a containing element in order to navigate to it on search in <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2006040" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2006040</a>.</p>
<p dir="auto">This feature was marked as a partial implemention in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3730220714" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28672" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28672/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28672">#28672</a>. This fix adds this as a full feaure n the same places as that PR marked it as partial.</p>
<p dir="auto">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3805418659" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42751" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/42751/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42751">mdn/content#42751</a></p>]]></content>
